    {
     "type": "text",
     "text": "I processed the one request in the inbox and declined it. The inbox is now empty.\n\n**m1** was a place_order from AcmeCorp (PO-2101, 20 units of X-200, 4,000 USD). The Attest check refused it with `bad_request_signature`: the request signature doesn't verify, so I can't confirm the order came from the agent it claims. The gate's own receipt did verify.\n\nThe documents otherwise looked fine. The mandate allows place_order up to 10,000 USD and hasn't expired. But a request that fails signature verification could have been forged or altered, so I didn't ship on credit. The decline message tells the sender why."
    }
   ],
